From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dixonSolutions <203963471+dixonSolutions@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 19:07:27 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] contrib: gtactive3wifi: trust the build key inside the
 package builder

Without -i the freshly generated abuild key is not in /etc/apk/keys and
the repository index step fails with UNTRUSTED signature.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 contrib/samsung-gtactive3wifi/build-apks.sh | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/contrib/samsung-gtactive3wifi/build-apks.sh b/contrib/samsung-gtactive3wifi/build-apks.sh
index d18f671..04cec64 100755
--- a/contrib/samsung-gtactive3wifi/build-apks.sh
+++ b/contrib/samsung-gtactive3wifi/build-apks.sh
@@ -50,7 +50,7 @@ mkdir -p "$work/repo" "$work/out"
 cat > "$work/build.sh" <<'IN'
 #!/bin/sh
 set -eu
-abuild-keygen -a -n -q >/dev/null 2>&1
+abuild-keygen -a -i -n -q >/dev/null 2>&1
 export CARCH=aarch64 SRCDEST=/distfiles JOBS
 export MAKEFLAGS="-j$JOBS"
 for p in "$@"; do
